    /// milestone within one isolate before the persisted message exists.
    /// </summary>
    abstract _inFlightDetachedNotifications: obj with get, set
    /// <summary>
    /// Serialize detached terminal delivery against the chat turn queue. A
    /// fast-path push or backbone tick can land mid-turn, and an <c>onFinish</c> that
    /// mutates chat state (<c>saveMessages</c>, <c>setState</c>, a follow-up
    /// <c>runAgentTool</c>) running concurrently with an active LLM turn is a data
    /// race. Those paths never run synchronously inside a turn body (they fire
    /// from <c>waitUntil</c> / a scheduled alarm), so enqueuing on the turn queue runs
    /// the delivery strictly between turns without risk of self-deadlock.
    /// <br /><br />
    /// An explicit <c>cancelAgentTool</c> (<c>serialize</c> unset) may be invoked from
    /// inside the very turn that triggers it, where enqueuing WOULD self-deadlock,
    /// so it runs inline in the caller's (or a fresh) <c>agentContext</c>.
    /// </summary>
