    /// + milestone NAME (deterministic message id), so the warm tail and the cold
    /// backbone reconcile converge to at most one message.
    /// <br /><br />
    /// - <c>"narrate"</c> (default): a synthetic <b>assistant</b> message injected directly
    ///   — no model turn.
    /// - <c>"react"</c>: a <b>user</b> message followed by a model turn so the agent
