    /// incident is that run's. Incidents in <c>detected</c>/<c>scheduled</c>/<c>attempting</c>
    /// mean recovery is still resolving the interrupted turn; <c>exhausted</c>/<c>failed</c>
    /// mean recovery gave up; a completed recovery deletes its incident.
